{
  "step": 6,
  "preference_text": "\n\n--- Refinement ---\nCarry the v0 project view forward unchanged, except: the nav gains\n\"Artifacts\" between Project and Settings, and each line in the round\ntree is a link (same colour, underline on hover only). Add two screens,\nsharing the status bar and nav exactly as v0 draws them. Same register:\ndark, dense, one accent, no decoration, Inter for UI text, JetBrains\nMono for every path, file name, model name, command and number.\n\nSCREEN 2 \u2014 Chat frame (nav: Project active). Top to bottom:\n\n1. Pill bar: the seven agent names in one row as plain text,\n   CodeScanner through Deployer. Brainstormer is active \u2014 accent text\n   with the same 1px underline as the active nav item. CodeScanner at\n   full weight (done). Agentifier, Designer, StackAdvisor at full weight\n   (reachable). Phaser and Deployer dimmed (unreachable). No arrows, no\n   glyphs, no Back button.\n2. Transcript: a bordered panel about 60% of the viewport tall. Show\n   four messages. Each is a block with a dimmed 11px speaker label\n   (\"Brainstormer\" / \"You\") above it; the user's block has a 2px neutral\n   left rule and nothing else; no fills, no rounded bubbles. The last\n   message is from Brainstormer and includes a short JSON code block\n   rendered in mono on the panel background.\n3. Run cost: the same three-line strip as the project view's round\n   cost, with run figures: \"Estimated cost, this run: $0.2134 \u00b7 Tokens:\n   32,880 in / 2,914 out\", second line \"all 6 calls priced\", third the\n   dimmed LiteLLM note.\n4. Action row, one line, 1px rule above: left, in mono, dimmed:\n   \"41,206 chars \u00b7 32,880 in / 2,914 out \u00b7 Elapsed: 1m 42s\". Right:\n   \"Open vision.json\" (neutral outline) \u00b7 \"Download\" (neutral outline)\n   \u00b7 \"Continue to Designer\" (neutral outline) \u00b7 \"Continue to Agentifier\"\n   (filled green \u2014 the only filled button on the screen).\n5. Progress bar: a thin (4px) striped bar, drawn in the active state\n   directly under the action row \u2014 this screen shows the frame as it\n   looks mid-run for that one element, so draw it as if animating; the\n   stripes are the accent at reduced opacity on the panel colour.\n6. Composer: a textarea, three lines tall, placeholder \"Reply\u2026\", with\n   \"Send\" as a neutral outline button at the right end.\n7. Under it, one line: left, the model chip \"claude-sonnet-5\" in mono\n   inside a neutral outline pill with \"change\" as dimmed text beside\n   it; right, a dimmed mono status line \"Brainstormer is replying\u2026\".\n\nSCREEN 3 \u2014 Artifact view (nav: Artifacts active). Two columns.\n\nLeft, 300px: a round selector at top \u2014 the rounds on disk as mono text\n\"v0 v1 v2 v3\", v3 marked like the active nav item. Under it the round\ntree exactly as the project view draws it (lanes, status flags,\nlegend), with vision.json marked as selected: accent text, no fill.\n\nRight, the rest: a header line in mono, dimmed except the path \u2014\n\".spec4/v3/vision.json \u00b7 4.2 KB \u00b7 modified 2026-09-06 14:12 \u00b7 reference\nfor the agent\" \u2014 with \"Download\" as a neutral outline button at the\nright end (for mock.html there would be a second, \"Open rendered\"; not\nshown here). Under it the file: pretty-printed JSON in 13px mono, line\nnumbers in a dimmed gutter, 1px rule around the block, scrolling inside\nthe block. Show about 30 lines of a plausible vision.json for Spec4\nitself. No syntax colouring beyond keys in the default text colour and\nvalues dimmed one step.\n\nAlso draw the empty state of the right pane as a small inset, if the\nformat allows: dimmed text \"Select a file\" \u2014 and the missing state:\n\"deployment-plan.md \u2014 missing \u2014 produced by Deployer\".\n\nThe attached screenshots show the current chat frame so you can see\nthe controls that exist. Reproduce the function, not the styling.",
  "screenshots": [],
  "mock_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Spec4 \u2014 /Users/rc/projects/bws4</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --bg: #0a0a0f;\n    --panel: #12121c;\n    --panel-2: #1a1a24;\n    --border: #2a2a3a;\n    --text: #f5f5f7;\n    --dim: #a0a0b0;\n    --faint: #5a5a6a;\n    --accent: #39FF14;\n    --accent-hover: #31e510;\n    --wordmark-blue: #1E88E5;\n    --lane-prompt: #e8925a;\n    --lane-record: #b39ddb;\n    --warn: #d8b84a;\n    --font-ui: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n    --font-mono: \"JetBrains Mono\", ui-monospace, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", monospace;\n  }\n\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n  html, body {\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    font-family: var(--font-ui);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n\n  .mono {\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    font-variant-ligatures: none;\n  }\n\n  :focus-visible {\n    outline: 1px solid var(--accent);\n    outline-offset: 1px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Status bar ---------- */\n  .statusbar {\n    height: 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n    background: var(--panel);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .sb-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n\n  .wordmark {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    flex: none;\n  }\n  .wm-spec { color: var(--wordmark-blue); }\n  .wm-4 { color: var(--accent); }\n\n  .sb-ctx {\n    color: var(--text);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  }\n  .sb-ctx .sep { color: var(--faint); padding: 0 6px; }\n  .sb-ctx .dim { color: var(--dim); }\n\n  .sb-nav {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    flex: none;\n  }\n  .sb-nav a {\n    color: var(--dim);\n    line-height: 38px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;\n    margin-bottom: -1px;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .sb-nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }\n  .sb-nav a.active {\n    color: var(--accent);\n    border-bottom-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .sb-version {\n    color: var(--dim);\n    margin-left: 8px;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);\n    line-height: 20px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- View ---------- */\n  .view {\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    padding: 16px 16px 32px;\n  }\n\n  section + section { margin-top: 24px; }\n\n  .section-head {\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 24px;\n    color: var(--text);\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Round tree ---------- */\n  .tree-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    width: 100%;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n  .tree-list li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    height: 24px;\n    padding: 0 8px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n  .tree-list li:nth-child(even) { background: var(--panel); }\n  .tree-list .name { white-space: nowrap; }\n  .tree-list .lane-prompt { color: var(--lane-prompt); }\n  .tree-list .lane-ref { color: var(--text); }\n  .tree-list .lane-record { color: var(--lane-record); }\n  .tree-list .status { color: var(--dim); white-space: nowrap; }\n  .tree-list li.is-missing .name { opacity: 0.55; }\n  .tree-list li.is-missing .status { color: var(--faint); }\n  .tree-list a.tree-link {\n    display: flex;\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n    height: 100%;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 16px;\n    color: inherit;\n  }\n  .tree-list a.tree-link:hover .name { text-decoration: underline; }\n  .tree-list li.is-selected .name { color: var(--accent); }\n\n  .legend {\n    list-style: none;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 24px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    color: var(--dim);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 16px;\n  }\n  .legend li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }\n  .swatch {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    flex: none;\n  }\n  .swatch.lane-prompt { background: var(--lane-prompt); }\n  .swatch.lane-ref { background: var(--text); }\n  .swatch.lane-record { background: var(--lane-record); }\n\n  /* ---------- Agent rows ---------- */\n  .agents-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n  .agents-table th,\n  .agents-table td {\n    height: 32px;\n    padding: 0 8px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .agents-table th {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--dim);\n    background: var(--panel);\n  }\n  .agents-table td.agent { font-weight: 500; width: 140px; }\n  .agents-table td.produces { width: 220px; }\n  .agents-table td.model { width: 220px; }\n  .agents-table td.tokens { width: 220px; color: var(--text); }\n  .agents-table td.model:empty::after,\n  .agents-table td.tokens:empty::after { content: \"\"; }\n  .agents-table th.action,\n  .agents-table td.action { text-align: right; width: 120px; }\n  .agents-table tr.is-disabled td.agent,\n  .agents-table tr.is-disabled td.produces { color: var(--dim); }\n\n  /* ---------- Buttons ---------- */\n  .btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    height: 24px;\n    min-width: 96px;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n    font-family: var(--font-ui);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 22px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--text);\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .btn:hover { border-color: #3a3a4a; }\n  .btn-primary {\n    background: var(--accent);\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--bg);\n  }\n  .btn-primary:hover {\n    background: var(--accent-hover);\n    border-color: var(--accent-hover);\n  }\n  .btn-modify {\n    color: var(--accent);\n    border-color: #3a3a4a;\n  }\n  .btn-modify:hover { border-color: #4a4a5a; }\n  .btn-warn {\n    color: var(--warn);\n    border-color: rgba(216, 184, 74, 0.45);\n  }\n  .btn-warn:hover { border-color: var(--warn); }\n  .btn-outline { color: var(--text); border-color: #3a3a4a; }\n  .btn:disabled,\n  .btn:disabled:hover {\n    color: var(--faint);\n    border-color: var(--border);\n    background: transparent;\n    cursor: default;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Round cost ---------- */\n  .cost {\n    background: var(--panel);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n  }\n  .cost-line {\n    line-height: 24px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  }\n  .cost-line .sep { color: var(--faint); padding: 0 6px; }\n  .cost-line .label { color: var(--dim); }\n  .cost-note {\n    color: var(--dim);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 16px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Chat frame ---------- */\n  .pipeline {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 20px;\n    height: 32px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .pipeline a,\n  .pipeline span {\n    color: var(--text);\n    line-height: 30px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;\n    margin-bottom: -1px;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .pipeline .is-active {\n    color: var(--accent);\n    border-bottom-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .pipeline .is-unreachable { color: var(--faint); }\n\n  .transcript {\n    height: 60vh;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    background: var(--bg);\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n  }\n  .msg + .msg { margin-top: 16px; }\n  .msg-label {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 16px;\n    color: var(--dim);\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .msg-body p + p { margin-top: 8px; }\n  .msg.is-user {\n    border-left: 2px solid #3a3a4a;\n    padding-left: 10px;\n  }\n  .msg pre.code {\n    background: var(--panel);\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    white-space: pre;\n    line-height: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .chat .cost { margin-top: 12px; }\n\n  .action-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 16px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n    margin-top: 12px;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n    line-height: 24px;\n  }\n  .action-meta {\n    color: var(--dim);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  }\n  .action-meta .sep { color: var(--faint); padding: 0 6px; }\n  .action-btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex: none; }\n\n  .progress {\n    height: 4px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    background: var(--panel);\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .progress.is-active {\n    background-image: linear-gradient(-45deg,\n      rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.45) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 50%,\n      rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.45) 50%, rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.45) 75%, transparent 75%);\n    background-size: 12px 12px;\n    animation: stripes 0.6s linear infinite;\n  }\n  @keyframes stripes { to { background-position: 12px 0; } }\n\n  .composer {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n  }\n  .composer textarea {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: block;\n    background: var(--panel);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    color: var(--text);\n    font-family: var(--font-ui);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    padding: 6px 8px;\n    resize: vertical;\n  }\n  .composer textarea::placeholder { color: var(--faint); }\n\n  .model-line {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 16px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .model-chip {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    height: 22px;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n    border: 1px solid #3a3a4a;\n    border-radius: 11px;\n    color: var(--text);\n  }\n  .model-change { color: var(--dim); margin-left: 8px; }\n  .status-line { color: var(--dim); white-space: nowrap; }\n\n  /* ---------- Artifact view ---------- */\n  .artifact-layout {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 300px minmax(0, 1fr);\n    gap: 24px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  .round-select {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    height: 32px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .round-select a {\n    color: var(--dim);\n    line-height: 30px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;\n    margin-bottom: -1px;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .round-select a:hover { color: var(--text); }\n  .round-select a.is-active {\n    color: var(--accent);\n    border-bottom-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n\n  .file-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 16px;\n    line-height: 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    color: var(--dim);\n  }\n  .file-head .file-meta {\n    min-width: 0;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  }\n  .file-head .path { color: var(--text); }\n  .file-head .sep { color: var(--faint); padding: 0 6px; }\n  .file-head .btn { flex: none; }\n\n  .file-block {\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    max-height: calc(100vh - 176px);\n    overflow: auto;\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    font-variant-ligatures: none;\n  }\n  .file-block .line { display: flex; min-width: max-content; }\n  .file-block .ln {\n    flex: none;\n    width: 44px;\n    padding-right: 10px;\n    text-align: right;\n    color: var(--faint);\n    background: var(--panel);\n    user-select: none;\n  }\n  .file-block .lc { padding: 0 12px; white-space: pre; }\n  .file-block .k { color: var(--text); }\n  .file-block .v { color: var(--dim); }\n  .file-block .no-preview { color: var(--faint); padding: 0 12px; }\n\n  .file-empty,\n  .file-missing {\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    padding: 32px 16px;\n    color: var(--dim);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .file-missing .path { color: var(--text); }\n\n  .state-insets {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 16px;\n    margin-top: 24px;\n  }\n  .inset-label {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 16px;\n    color: var(--faint);\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .state-insets .file-empty,\n  .state-insets .file-missing { padding: 20px 12px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header class=\"statusbar\" id=\"statusbar\">\n  <div class=\"sb-left\">\n    <a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"#project\" aria-label=\"Spec4\"><span class=\"wm-spec\">Spec</span><span class=\"wm-4\">4</span></a>\n    <span class=\"sb-ctx mono\" id=\"sb-ctx\"></span>\n  </div>\n  <nav class=\"sb-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n    <a href=\"#project\" class=\"active\" aria-current=\"page\" data-nav=\"project\">Project</a>\n    <a href=\"#artifacts\" data-nav=\"artifacts\">Artifacts</a>\n    <a href=\"#settings\" data-nav=\"settings\">Settings</a>\n    <a href=\"https://spec4.ai/docs\" data-nav=\"docs\" rel=\"noopener\">Docs</a>\n    <span class=\"sb-version mono\" id=\"sb-version\"></span>\n  </nav>\n</header>\n\n<!-- ================= Screen 1: Project view ================= -->\n<main class=\"view\" id=\"project-view\">\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"tree-head\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-head\" id=\"tree-head\"></h2>\n    <ol class=\"tree-list\" id=\"tree-list\"></ol>\n    <ul class=\"legend\" aria-label=\"Lanes\">\n      <li><span class=\"swatch lane-prompt\"></span>prompts for the agent</li>\n      <li><span class=\"swatch lane-ref\"></span>reference for the agent</li>\n      <li><span class=\"swatch lane-record\"></span>a record for you</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-label=\"Agents\">\n    <table class=\"agents-table\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Agent</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Produces</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Last model</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Tokens this round</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"action\"><span class=\"sr-only\"></span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody id=\"agent-rows\"></tbody>\n    </table>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"cost\" aria-label=\"Round cost\">\n    <div class=\"cost-line mono\" id=\"cost-line\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cost-line mono\" id=\"cost-unpriced\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cost-note\" id=\"cost-note\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n</main>\n\n<!-- ================= Screen 2: Chat frame ================= -->\n<main class=\"view chat\" id=\"chat-view\" hidden>\n\n  <div class=\"pipeline\" id=\"pipeline\" aria-label=\"Pipeline\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"transcript\" id=\"transcript\" aria-label=\"Transcript\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"cost\" aria-label=\"Run cost\">\n    <div class=\"cost-line mono\" id=\"run-cost-line\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cost-line mono\" id=\"run-cost-unpriced\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cost-note\" id=\"run-cost-note\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"action-row\">\n    <div class=\"action-meta mono\" id=\"action-meta\"></div>\n    <div class=\"action-btns\" id=\"action-btns\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"progress is-active\" id=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Agent activity\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"composer\">\n    <textarea id=\"composer-input\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Reply\u2026\" aria-label=\"Reply\"></textarea>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"send-btn\">Send</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"model-line\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"model-chip mono\" id=\"model-chip\"></span><span class=\"model-change\">change</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"status-line mono\" id=\"status-line\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n</main>\n\n<!-- ================= Screen 3: Artifact view ================= -->\n<main class=\"view\" id=\"artifact-view\" hidden>\n  <div class=\"artifact-layout\">\n\n    <aside aria-label=\"Rounds and artifacts\">\n      <div class=\"round-select mono\" id=\"round-select\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-head\" id=\"av-tree-head\"></h2>\n      <ol class=\"tree-list\" id=\"av-tree-list\"></ol>\n      <ul class=\"legend\" aria-label=\"Lanes\">\n        <li><span class=\"swatch lane-prompt\"></span>prompts for the agent</li>\n        <li><span class=\"swatch lane-ref\"></span>reference for the agent</li>\n        <li><span class=\"swatch lane-record\"></span>a record for you</li>\n      </ul>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div>\n      <div id=\"file-pane\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"state-insets\" aria-label=\"Pane states\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"inset-label\">empty state</div>\n          <div class=\"file-empty mono\">Select a file</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"inset-label\">missing state</div>\n          <div class=\"file-missing mono\"><span class=\"path\">deployment-plan.md</span> \u2014 missing \u2014 produced by Deployer</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  // Project state \u2014 the shell recomputes the status bar from this on\n  // every render so it can never show a stale directory or round.\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  var project = {\n    workingDirectory: \"/Users/rc/projects/bws4\",\n    round: 3,\n    roundsOnDisk: [0, 1, 2, 3],\n    defaultProvider: \"anthropic\",\n    defaultModel: \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n    version: \"0.6.0\"\n  };\n\n  // Current round's artifacts, in pipeline order. `mtime` null = missing\n  // from disk. `upstream` drives staleness: an artifact needs update when\n  // any upstream artifact is newer. usage.json is exempt. `agent` is the\n  // producer, used by the Artifact View's missing-file message.\n  var artifacts = [\n    { path: \"code_review.json\",      lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-02T09:14:00Z\", upstream: [], agent: \"CodeScanner\" },\n    { path: \"vision.json\",           lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-04T16:42:00Z\", upstream: [\"code_review.json\"], agent: \"Brainstormer\" },\n    { path: \"feature_specs.json\",    lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-04T17:05:00Z\", upstream: [\"vision.json\"], agent: \"Brainstormer\" },\n    { path: \"ai_features.json\",      lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-04T17:31:00Z\", upstream: [\"vision.json\", \"feature_specs.json\"], agent: \"Agentifier\" },\n    { path: \"design/mock.html\",      lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-05T10:20:00Z\", upstream: [\"vision.json\", \"feature_specs.json\", \"ai_features.json\"], agent: \"Designer\" },\n    { path: \"design/manifest.json\",  lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-05T10:20:00Z\", upstream: [\"vision.json\", \"feature_specs.json\", \"ai_features.json\"], agent: \"Designer\" },\n    { path: \"stack.json\",            lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-03T11:08:00Z\", upstream: [\"vision.json\", \"ai_features.json\"], agent: \"StackAdvisor\" },\n    { path: \"phases/phase1.md\",      lane: \"prompt\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:02:00Z\", upstream: [\"stack.json\", \"design/manifest.json\"], agent: \"Phaser\" },\n    { path: \"phases/phase2.md\",      lane: \"prompt\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:02:00Z\", upstream: [\"stack.json\", \"design/manifest.json\"], agent: \"Phaser\" },\n    { path: \"phases/phase3.md\",      lane: \"prompt\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:02:00Z\", upstream: [\"stack.json\", \"design/manifest.json\"], agent: \"Phaser\" },\n    { path: \"phases/phase4.md\",      lane: \"prompt\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:02:00Z\", upstream: [\"stack.json\", \"design/manifest.json\"], agent: \"Phaser\" },\n    { path: \"phases/phase5.md\",      lane: \"prompt\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:02:00Z\", upstream: [\"stack.json\", \"design/manifest.json\"], agent: \"Phaser\" },\n    { path: \"deployment-plan.md\",    lane: \"prompt\", mtime: null,                   upstream: [\"phases/phase5.md\"], agent: \"Deployer\" },\n    { path: \"usage.json\",            lane: \"record\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:44:00Z\", upstream: [], exempt: true, agent: \"Spec4\" }\n  ];\n\n  var laneLabel = {\n    prompt: \"prompts for the agent\",\n    ref:    \"reference for the agent\",\n    record: \"a record for you\"\n  };\n\n  // Seven agents in fixed pipeline order. `action` comes from the existing\n  // readiness state model; it is not re-derived here. Model/tokens come\n  // from the round's usage record and are blank when the agent has not run.\n  var agents = [\n    { name: \"CodeScanner\",  produces: \"code_review.json\",   model: \"claude-sonnet-4-6\", tokensIn: 41206, tokensOut: 3118, action: \"Modify\" },\n    { name: \"Brainstormer\", produces: \"vision.json\",        model: \"claude-sonnet-4-6\", tokensIn: 32880, tokensOut: 2914, action: \"Modify\" },\n    { name: \"Agentifier\",   produces: \"ai_features.json\",   model: \"gpt-5-mini\",        tokensIn: 17451, tokensOut: 1206, action: \"Modify\" },\n    { name: \"Designer\",     produces: \"design/mock.html\",   model: \"claude-sonnet-4-6\", tokensIn: 18649, tokensOut: 1530, action: \"Modify\" },\n    { name: \"StackAdvisor\", produces: \"stack.json\",         model: \"gpt-5-mini\",        tokensIn: 8216,  tokensOut: 872,  action: \"Needs Update\" },\n    { name: \"Phaser\",       produces: \"phases/\",            model: null, tokensIn: null, tokensOut: null, action: \"Not Ready\" },\n    { name: \"Deployer\",     produces: \"deployment-plan.md\", model: null, tokensIn: null, tokensOut: null, action: \"Not Ready\" }\n  ];\n\n  // Aggregated usage for the round. Unpriced calls are listed by name and\n  // are excluded from costUsd, never folded in as zero.\n  var usage = {\n    round: 3,\n    calls: 19,\n    tokensIn: 118402,\n    tokensOut: 9640,\n    costUsd: 0.7312,\n    unpriced: [\n      { agent: \"Agentifier\",   model: \"gpt-5-mini\", calls: 1 },\n      { agent: \"StackAdvisor\", model: \"gpt-5-mini\", calls: 1 }\n    ],\n    priceSource: \"LiteLLM's price map\"\n  };\n\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  // Chat frame state \u2014 the Brainstormer run for this round.\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  var run = {\n    agent: \"Brainstormer\",\n    model: \"claude-sonnet-5\",\n    produces: \"vision.json\",\n    next: \"Agentifier\",\n    skipTo: \"Designer\",\n    pipeline: [\n      { name: \"CodeScanner\",  state: \"done\" },\n      { name: \"Brainstormer\", state: \"active\" },\n      { name: \"Agentifier\",   state: \"reachable\" },\n      { name: \"Designer\",     state: \"reachable\" },\n      { name: \"StackAdvisor\", state: \"reachable\" },\n      { name: \"Phaser\",       state: \"unreachable\" },\n      { name: \"Deployer\",     state: \"unreachable\" }\n    ],\n    chars: 41206,\n    turnTokensIn: 32880,\n    turnTokensOut: 2914,\n    elapsed: \"1m 42s\",\n    status: \"Brainstormer is replying\u2026\",\n    usage: {\n      calls: 6,\n      tokensIn: 32880,\n      tokensOut: 2914,\n      costUsd: 0.2134,\n      unpriced: [],\n      priceSource: \"LiteLLM's price map\"\n    },\n    messages: [\n      { from: \"user\", paras: [\n        \"Spec4 \u2014 a local-first pipeline of seven planning agents that turns a rough idea or an existing codebase into a versioned folder of specs a coding agent can execute phase by phase. Runs as a local web app at localhost:8050, bring-your-own-key across eight providers; keys never leave the browser.\"\n      ] },\n      { from: \"agent\", paras: [\n        \"Clear framing. Before I draft vision.json I want two things pinned down:\",\n        \"1. Who is the user \u2014 one audience or several? 2. What is this round's goal, as distinct from the product's purpose?\"\n      ] },\n      { from: \"user\", paras: [\n        \"One audience: developers who already use Claude Code or Kiro daily and are skeptical of spec-driven tooling. This round: bring the chat frame into the dev-tool register and add the Artifact View the round tree was designed to open into. The wizards stay unchanged until v2.\"\n      ] },\n      { from: \"agent\", paras: [\n        \"Good \u2014 that is enough to draft. Here is the head of vision.json as I would write it; the differentiators are carried forward from v2 unchanged:\"\n      ], code: [\n        '{',\n        '  \"name\": \"Spec4\",',\n        '  \"round\": 3,',\n        '  \"target_audience\": [',\n        '    \"Developers who use Claude Code or Kiro daily and are skeptical of spec-driven tooling\"',\n        '  ],',\n        '  \"this_round\": \"Chat frame register + Artifact View\"',\n        '}'\n      ], after: [\n        \"Tell me what is off and I will revise, or continue to Agentifier when it reads right.\"\n      ] }\n    ]\n  };\n\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  // Artifact View state \u2014 file metadata and content per artifact path.\n  // Only files in the reviewed artifact table are ever resolvable.\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  var artifactFiles = {\n    \"vision.json\": {\n      size: \"4.2 KB\",\n      modified: \"2026-09-06 14:12\",\n      lines: [\n        '{',\n        '  \"name\": \"Spec4\",',\n        '  \"round\": 3,',\n        '  \"purpose\": \"A local-first pipeline of seven planning agents that turns a rough idea or an existing codebase into a versioned folder of specs (.spec4/v{N}/), ready for a coding agent to execute phase by phase.\",',\n        '  \"ui_surface\": \"Web app \u2014 Python, Dash, Dash Mantine Components \u2014 served locally at localhost:8050.\",',\n        '  \"target_audience\": [',\n        '    \"Developers who already use Claude Code, Kiro, or similar AI coding agents daily, and who are skeptical of spec-driven tooling.\"',\n        '  ],',\n        '  \"differentiators\": [',\n        '    \"The open .spec4 file format, directly visible and navigable in the round tree and Artifact View.\",',\n        '    \"Any LLM model usable at any pipeline step.\",',\n        '    \"Per-step cost tracking.\",',\n        '    \"Staleness detection across the artifact dependency graph.\"',\n        '  ],',\n        '  \"this_round\": {',\n        '    \"goal\": \"Extend the dev-tool register to the chat frame and add the Artifact View.\",',\n        '    \"in_scope\": [',\n        '      \"Chat frame register\",',\n        '      \"Artifact View\",',\n        '      \"Artifact links\"',\n        '    ],',\n        '    \"deferred\": [',\n        '      \"Setup wizard\",',\n        '      \"Gate card\",',\n        '      \"Directory picker\",',\n        '      \"Designer wizard\"',\n        '    ]',\n        '  },',\n        '  \"constraints\": {',\n        '    \"keys_stay_in_browser\": true,',\n        '    \"reads_confined_to_spec_folder\": true,',\n        '    \"port\": 8050',\n        '  }',\n        '}'\n      ]\n    }\n  };\n\n  var artifactView = { round: \"v\" + project.round, selected: \"vision.json\" };\n\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  var fmt = function (n) { return n.toLocaleString(\"en-US\"); };\n  var esc = function (s) {\n    return String(s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g, function (c) {\n      return { \"&\": \"&amp;\", \"<\": \"&lt;\", \">\": \"&gt;\", '\"': \"&quot;\" }[c];\n    });\n  };\n\n  function renderStatusBar() {\n    var ctx = document.getElementById(\"sb-ctx\");\n    ctx.innerHTML =\n      esc(project.workingDirectory) +\n      '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>round v' + project.round +\n      '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>' + esc(project.defaultProvider) +\n      '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>' + esc(project.defaultModel);\n    document.getElementById(\"sb-version\").textContent = project.version;\n    document.title = \"Spec4 \u2014 \" + project.workingDirectory;\n  }\n\n  function renderNav(active) {\n    document.querySelectorAll(\".sb-nav a\").forEach(function (a) {\n      var on = a.getAttribute(\"data-nav\") === active;\n      a.classList.toggle(\"active\", on);\n      if (on) a.setAttribute(\"aria-current\", \"page\"); else a.removeAttribute(\"aria-current\");\n    });\n  }\n\n  function artifactStatus(a, byPath) {\n    if (!a.mtime) return \"missing\";\n    if (a.exempt) return \"present\";\n    var t = Date.parse(a.mtime);\n    for (var i = 0; i < a.upstream.length; i++) {\n      var up = byPath[a.upstream[i]];\n      if (up && up.mtime && Date.parse(up.mtime) > t) return \"needs update\";\n    }\n    return \"present\";\n  }\n\n  function artifactsByPath() {\n    var byPath = {};\n    artifacts.forEach(function (a) { byPath[a.path] = a; });\n    return byPath;\n  }\n\n  // Draws the round tree into a list; each line is a link into the\n  // Artifact View. `selected` marks one path in accent (Artifact View).\n  function renderTree(headEl, listEl, round, selected) {\n    headEl.textContent = \".spec4/\" + round + \"/\";\n    var byPath = artifactsByPath();\n    listEl.innerHTML = artifacts.map(function (a) {\n      var status = artifactStatus(a, byPath);\n      var cls = status === \"missing\" ? \" is-missing\" : \"\";\n      if (selected && a.path === selected) cls += \" is-selected\";\n      // \"present\" is the default and is not labelled; only exceptions show.\n      var label = status === \"present\" ? \"\" : status;\n      return '<li class=\"mono' + cls + '\">' +\n        '<a class=\"tree-link\" href=\"#artifacts/' + esc(round) + '/' + esc(a.path) + '\" data-path=\"' + esc(a.path) + '\" data-round=\"' + esc(round) + '\">' +\n        '<span class=\"name lane-' + a.lane + '\">' + esc(a.path) + '</span>' +\n        '<span class=\"status\">' + label + '</span>' +\n        '</a></li>';\n    }).join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  var actionClass = {\n    \"Start\":        \"btn-primary\",\n    \"Continue\":     \"btn-primary\",\n    \"Modify\":       \"btn-modify\",\n    \"Needs Update\": \"btn-warn\",\n    \"Not Ready\":    \"btn-outline\",\n    \"Required\":     \"btn-outline\"\n  };\n\n  function renderAgents() {\n    var body = document.getElementById(\"agent-rows\");\n    body.innerHTML = agents.map(function (ag) {\n      var disabled = ag.action === \"Not Ready\";\n      var hasRun = ag.model !== null;\n      var tokens = hasRun ? fmt(ag.tokensIn) + \" in / \" + fmt(ag.tokensOut) + \" out\" : \"\";\n      return '<tr' + (disabled ? ' class=\"is-disabled\"' : \"\") + \">\" +\n        '<td class=\"agent\">' + esc(ag.name) + \"</td>\" +\n        '<td class=\"produces mono\">' + esc(ag.produces) + \"</td>\" +\n        '<td class=\"model mono\">' + (hasRun ? esc(ag.model) : \"\") + \"</td>\" +\n        '<td class=\"tokens mono\">' + tokens + \"</td>\" +\n        '<td class=\"action\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ' + actionClass[ag.action] + '\"' +\n          ' data-agent=\"' + esc(ag.name) + '\"' + (disabled ? \" disabled\" : \"\") + \">\" +\n          esc(ag.action) + \"</button></td>\" +\n        \"</tr>\";\n    }).join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  // Shared three-line cost strip: used for the round (project view) and\n  // for the completed run (chat frame), sourced from the same estimate.\n  function renderCostStrip(u, label, lineEl, unpricedEl, noteEl) {\n    var unpricedCalls = u.unpriced.reduce(function (n, x) { return n + x.calls; }, 0);\n    var pricedCalls = u.calls - unpricedCalls;\n\n    // Never show an all-zero figure when the true cost is unknown.\n    var figure;\n    if (u.calls === 0) {\n      figure = \"no calls recorded\";\n    } else if (pricedCalls === 0) {\n      figure = \"unknown\";\n    } else {\n      figure = \"$\" + u.costUsd.toFixed(4);\n    }\n\n    var parts = [\n      '<span class=\"label\">' + esc(label) + \"</span> \" + figure,\n      '<span class=\"label\">Tokens:</span> ' + fmt(u.tokensIn) + \" in / \" + fmt(u.tokensOut) + \" out\"\n    ];\n    lineEl.innerHTML = parts.join('<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>');\n\n    if (unpricedCalls > 0) {\n      var names = u.unpriced.map(function (x) {\n        return esc(x.agent) + \" (\" + esc(x.model) + \")\";\n      }).join(\", \");\n      unpricedEl.textContent = unpricedCalls + \" of \" + u.calls + \" calls could not be priced and are excluded: \" + names;\n      unpricedEl.hidden = false;\n    } else if (u.calls > 0) {\n      unpricedEl.textContent = \"all \" + u.calls + \" calls priced\";\n      unpricedEl.hidden = false;\n    } else {\n      unpricedEl.textContent = \"\";\n      unpricedEl.hidden = true;\n    }\n    noteEl.textContent = \"Estimates from \" + u.priceSource + \"; your provider's billing is authoritative.\";\n  }\n\n  function renderCost() {\n    renderCostStrip(usage, \"Estimated cost, v\" + usage.round + \":\",\n      document.getElementById(\"cost-line\"),\n      document.getElementById(\"cost-unpriced\"),\n      document.getElementById(\"cost-note\"));\n  }\n\n  // ---------- Chat frame ----------\n  function renderChat() {\n    document.getElementById(\"pipeline\").innerHTML = run.pipeline.map(function (p) {\n      var cls = p.state === \"active\" ? \"is-active\" : p.state === \"unreachable\" ? \"is-unreachable\" : \"\";\n      if (p.state === \"unreachable\") {\n        return '<span class=\"' + cls + '\" aria-disabled=\"true\">' + esc(p.name) + \"</span>\";\n      }\n      return '<a class=\"' + cls + '\" href=\"#agent/' + esc(p.name.toLowerCase()) + '\"' +\n        (p.state === \"active\" ? ' aria-current=\"step\"' : \"\") + \">\" + esc(p.name) + \"</a>\";\n    }).join(\"\");\n\n    document.getElementById(\"transcript\").innerHTML = run.messages.map(function (m) {\n      var isUser = m.from === \"user\";\n      var html = '<div class=\"msg' + (isUser ? \" is-user\" : \"\") + '\">' +\n        '<div class=\"msg-label\">' + (isUser ? \"You\" : esc(run.agent)) + \"</div>\" +\n        '<div class=\"msg-body\">' +\n        m.paras.map(function (p) { return \"<p>\" + esc(p) + \"</p>\"; }).join(\"\");\n      if (m.code) html += '<pre class=\"code mono\">' + m.code.map(esc).join(\"\\n\") + \"</pre>\";\n      if (m.after) html += m.after.map(function (p) { return '<p style=\"margin-top:8px\">' + esc(p) + \"</p>\"; }).join(\"\");\n      return html + \"</div></div>\";\n    }).join(\"\");\n\n    renderCostStrip(run.usage, \"Estimated cost, this run:\",\n      document.getElementById(\"run-cost-line\"),\n      document.getElementById(\"run-cost-unpriced\"),\n      document.getElementById(\"run-cost-note\"));\n\n    document.getElementById(\"action-meta\").innerHTML =\n      fmt(run.chars) + \" chars\" +\n      '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>' + fmt(run.turnTokensIn) + \" in / \" + fmt(run.turnTokensOut) + \" out\" +\n      '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>Elapsed: ' + esc(run.elapsed);\n\n    document.getElementById(\"action-btns\").innerHTML =\n      '<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-open=\"' + esc(run.produces) + '\">Open ' + esc(run.produces) + \"</button>\" +\n      '<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-download=\"' + esc(run.produces) + '\">Download</button>' +\n      '<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-goto=\"' + esc(run.skipTo) + '\">Continue to ' + esc(run.skipTo) + \"</button>\" +\n      '<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-goto=\"' + esc(run.next) + '\">Continue to ' + esc(run.next) + \"</button>\";\n\n    document.getElementById(\"model-chip\").textContent = run.model;\n    document.getElementById(\"status-line\").textContent = run.status;\n  }\n\n  // ---------- Artifact view ----------\n  function jsonLine(s) {\n    var m = s.match(/^(\\s*)(\"(?:[^\"\\\\]|\\\\.)*\")(\\s*:\\s*)(.*)$/);\n    if (m) {\n      return esc(m[1]) + '<span class=\"k\">' + esc(m[2]) + \"</span>\" + esc(m[3]) +\n        '<span class=\"v\">' + esc(m[4]) + \"</span>\";\n    }\n    if (/^\\s*\"/.test(s)) return '<span class=\"v\">' + esc(s) + \"</span>\";\n    return esc(s);\n  }\n\n  function fmtMtime(iso) {\n    return iso.slice(0, 10) + \" \" + iso.slice(11, 16);\n  }\n\n  function renderFilePane() {\n    var pane = document.getElementById(\"file-pane\");\n    var sel = artifactView.selected;\n    var byPath = artifactsByPath();\n    // Paths outside the reviewed artifact table are never resolvable.\n    var a = sel ? byPath[sel] : null;\n\n    if (!a) {\n      pane.innerHTML = '<div class=\"file-empty mono\">Select a file</div>';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var full = \".spec4/\" + artifactView.round + \"/\" + a.path;\n    var meta = artifactFiles[a.path];\n    var head = '<span class=\"path\">' + esc(full) + \"</span>\";\n\n    if (!a.mtime) {\n      head += '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>missing<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>' + esc(laneLabel[a.lane]);\n      pane.innerHTML =\n        '<div class=\"file-head mono\"><span class=\"file-meta\">' + head + \"</span>\" +\n        '<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" disabled>Download</button></div>' +\n        '<div class=\"file-missing mono\"><span class=\"path\">' + esc(a.path) + \"</span> \u2014 missing \u2014 produced by \" + esc(a.agent) + \"</div>\";\n      return;\n    }\n\n    if (meta && meta.size) head += '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>' + esc(meta.size);\n    head += '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>modified ' + esc(meta && meta.modified ? meta.modified : fmtMtime(a.mtime));\n    head += '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>' + esc(laneLabel[a.lane]);\n\n    var body;\n    if (meta && meta.lines) {\n      body = meta.lines.map(function (line, i) {\n        return '<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"ln\">' + (i + 1) + '</span><span class=\"lc\">' + jsonLine(line) + \"</span></div>\";\n      }).join(\"\");\n    } else {\n      body = '<div class=\"line\"><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"no-preview\">preview not included in this mock</span></div>';\n    }\n\n    pane.innerHTML =\n      '<div class=\"file-head mono\"><span class=\"file-meta\">' + head + \"</span>\" +\n      '<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-download=\"' + esc(a.path) + '\">Download</button></div>' +\n      '<div class=\"file-block\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"' + esc(a.path) + '\">' + body + \"</div>\";\n  }\n\n  function renderArtifactView() {\n    document.getElementById(\"round-select\").innerHTML = project.roundsOnDisk.map(function (r) {\n      var id = \"v\" + r;\n      var on = id === artifactView.round;\n      return '<a href=\"#artifacts/' + id + '\" class=\"' + (on ? \"is-active\" : \"\") + '\"' +\n        (on ? ' aria-current=\"true\"' : \"\") + \">\" + id + \"</a>\";\n    }).join(\"\");\n    renderTree(document.getElementById(\"av-tree-head\"), document.getElementById(\"av-tree-list\"),\n      artifactView.round, artifactView.selected);\n    renderFilePane();\n  }\n\n  function render() {\n    renderStatusBar();\n    renderTree(document.getElementById(\"tree-head\"), document.getElementById(\"tree-list\"), \"v\" + project.round, null);\n    renderAgents();\n    renderCost();\n    renderChat();\n    renderArtifactView();\n  }\n\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  // Routing \u2014 the hash picks the screen; the nav is recomputed from it.\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  function showView(id) {\n    [\"project-view\", \"chat-view\", \"artifact-view\"].forEach(function (v) {\n      document.getElementById(v).hidden = v !== id;\n    });\n  }\n\n  function route() {\n    var h = decodeURIComponent(location.hash.replace(/^#/, \"\")) || \"project\";\n    if (h.indexOf(\"agent/\") === 0) {\n      renderNav(\"project\");\n      renderChat();\n      showView(\"chat-view\");\n    } else if (h.indexOf(\"artifacts\") === 0) {\n      var m = h.match(/^artifacts(?:\\/(v\\d+)(?:\\/(.+))?)?$/);\n      if (m) {\n        if (m[1]) artifactView.round = m[1];\n        if (m[2]) artifactView.selected = m[2];\n      }\n      renderNav(\"artifacts\");\n      renderArtifactView();\n      showView(\"artifact-view\");\n    } else if (h === \"project\") {\n      renderNav(\"project\");\n      render();\n      showView(\"project-view\");\n    } else {\n      renderNav(h);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Row actions route to the agent exactly as the existing agent-select\n  // buttons do; the mock records the intent in the URL hash.\n  document.getElementById(\"agent-rows\").addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\n    var btn = e.target.closest(\"button[data-agent]\");\n    if (!btn || btn.disabled) return;\n    location.hash = \"agent/\" + btn.getAttribute(\"data-agent\").toLowerCase();\n  });\n\n  // Round-tree lines resolve their target at the moment of selection.\n  document.addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\n    var link = e.target.closest(\"a.tree-link\");\n    if (!link) return;\n    e.preventDefault();\n    location.hash = \"artifacts/\" + link.getAttribute(\"data-round\") + \"/\" + link.getAttribute(\"data-path\");\n  });\n\n  // Chat action row: open the artifact in place, or continue the pipeline.\n  document.getElementById(\"action-btns\").addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\n    var btn = e.target.closest(\"button\");\n    if (!btn) return;\n    if (btn.hasAttribute(\"data-open\")) {\n      location.hash = \"artifacts/v\" + project.round + \"/\" + btn.getAttribute(\"data-open\");\n    } else if (btn.hasAttribute(\"data-goto\")) {\n      location.hash = \"agent/\" + btn.getAttribute(\"data-goto\").toLowerCase();\n    }\n  });\n\n  // Nav marks the current view; the router recomputes the active entry.\n  document.querySelector(\".sb-nav\").addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\n    var link = e.target.closest(\"a[data-nav]\");\n    if (!link || link.getAttribute(\"data-nav\") === \"docs\") return;\n    e.preventDefault();\n    location.hash = link.getAttribute(\"data-nav\");\n  });\n\n  window.addEventListener(\"hashchange\", route);\n\n  render();\n  route();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "finalized": true
}